        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GOING TO SCHOOL WITH LIRA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you ever make it to class? There's no rush, but there are plenty of strange obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Going To High School with Lira is a relaxed and peculiar 2D platform game where a simple click of the mouse is all you need. Move at your own pace on a day that started out normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Main Features:**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-   **Single-Player Adventure:** Enjoy this absurd, solitary stroll at your own rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-  **Simple Controls:** Jump with a mouse click. The challenge isn't speed, but the precision to not fall to the bottom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-  **A Surreal and Peaceful Path:** Your route is plagued by inexplicable yet peaceful obstacles: bananas moving left and right, ice creams and other desserts blocking your path. There are no evil enemies, just a strange world to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not a race, it's a stroll. Your mouse-click precision and your patience will decide how this ordinarily extra-ordinary day ends.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GOING TO SCHOOL WITH LIRA</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you ever make it to class? There's no rush, but there are plenty of strange obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Going To High School with Lira is a relaxed and peculiar 2D platform game where a simple click of the mouse is all you need. Move at your own pace on a day that started out normal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >**Main Features:**</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-   **Single-Player Adventure:** Enjoy this absurd, solitary stroll at your own rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-  **Simple Controls:** Jump with a mouse click. The challenge isn't speed, but the precision to not fall to the bottom!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-  **A Surreal and Peaceful Path:** Your route is plagued by inexplicable yet peaceful obstacles: bananas moving left and right, ice creams and other desserts blocking your path. There are no evil enemies, just a strange world to overcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not a race, it's a stroll. Your mouse-click precision and your patience will decide how this ordinarily extra-ordinary day ends.</p>",
        "short_description": "A relaxed 2D platformer where you guide Lira through a surreal journey filled with bizarre obstacles. Jump with a single mouse click, take your time, and enjoy a strange yet peaceful adventure. No rush, just precision!",
